                           hpqÀii ðn þ 1Þ ¼ hpqÀii ðnÞ þ epÀi ðnÞuqÀi ðnÞ                                                  (33)

where  is the step-size parameter, and exÀr;yÀr ðnÞ and exÀi;yÀi ðnÞ are the real and imaginary parts
of ex;y ðnÞ, respectively.

